{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/239b6f5765ea53fb0422ac481b88a7e0.avif?t=1752917517\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh hi ! <br>You're the new intern right ?... Good good. <br>There are two rules in this company : Do your job and stay at your place. <br>Remember this, and it will all go down nicely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now here is your gun and your contract. The elevator is just down the corridor. You got work to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/f8de3c3842683d4e4f9d4fd3527d8a6b.poster.avif?t=1752917517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/f8de3c3842683d4e4f9d4fd3527d8a6b.webm?t=1752917517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/f8de3c3842683d4e4f9d4fd3527d8a6b.mp4?t=1752917517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You got back ! Not yet burned out hey ?... Oh, it will come soon, enough.    <br>Good thing you brought back some resources ! This office could really use an upgrade or two.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/a732762fbfc189e5ec985e6bd5a0e784.poster.avif?t=1752917517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/a732762fbfc189e5ec985e6bd5a0e784.webm?t=1752917517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/a732762fbfc189e5ec985e6bd5a0e784.mp4?t=1752917517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're going back in ? If you find colleagues down there, tell them I said hi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/5668eb311ca28f50bc7e3c451a539de4.poster.avif?t=1752917517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/5668eb311ca28f50bc7e3c451a539de4.webm?t=1752917517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/5668eb311ca28f50bc7e3c451a539de4.mp4?t=1752917517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, what you got here ?! I'm not sure this is allowed... You should put it back where you found it and pretend it does not exist.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/376ed415fa9aea3326cc5106cde6df00.poster.avif?t=1752917517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/376ed415fa9aea3326cc5106cde6df00.webm?t=1752917517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/376ed415fa9aea3326cc5106cde6df00.mp4?t=1752917517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Damn, where are we ?    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/48a87d8d172f52ccb90ebd7b806afd68.poster.avif?t=1752917517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878530/extras/48a87d